&lt;h2 id="vector-boundaries">Vector Boundaries&lt;/h2>
&lt;h4 id="natural-earth">Natural Earth&lt;/h4>
&lt;p>Land boundaries: Made with Natural Earth. Free vector and raster map data&lt;/p>
&lt;p>Natural Earth is a public domain map dataset available at 1:10m, 1:50m, and 1:110 million scales. Featuring tightly integrated vector and raster data, with Natural Earth you can make a variety of visually pleasing, well-crafted maps with cartography or GIS software.&lt;/p>
